sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant Client as "Client"
participant API as "HTTP API (apis)"
participant Menu as "Menu Module"
participant Order as "Order Module"
participant Driver as "Driver Module"
participant Redis as "Redis (data + GEO)"
participant Kafka as "Kafka"
participant Consumer as "Order Consumers"
participant Simulator as "Simulator"

Client->>API: POST /restaurant/enroll
API->>Menu: EnrollRestaurant
Menu->>Redis: Save restaurant
Menu->>Redis: Save menu
API-->>Client: 200 OK

Client->>API: POST /driver/enroll
API->>Driver: EnrollDriver
Driver->>Redis: HSET drivers
API-->>Client: 200 OK

Simulator->>Driver: UpdateLocation
Driver->>Redis: GEOADD drivers_geo
Driver->>Redis: HSET drivers

Client->>API: POST /order
API->>Order: PlaceOrder
Order->>Redis: Save order
Order->>Kafka: Publish assign evt
Order->>Kafka: Publish status placed
API-->>Client: 200 created

Consumer->>Kafka: Consume assign evt
Consumer->>Driver: Find+reserve nearest
Driver->>Redis: GEORADIUS by user loc
Driver->>Redis: SETNX driver_lock:id
Consumer->>Order: Update order assigned
Consumer->>Kafka: Publish status assigned

Client->>API: GET /order/get?id=...
API->>Order: GetOrder
Order->>Redis: HGET orders
API-->>Client: Order with driver+status

Client->>API: POST /order/delivered
API->>Kafka: Publish status delivered
API-->>Client: 200 OK

Consumer->>Kafka: Consume status evt
Consumer->>Order: Update status
Consumer->>Driver: ReleaseDriver
Driver->>Redis: DEL driver_lock:id

Client->>API: GET /drivers
API->>Driver: ListDrivers
Driver->>Redis: HVALS drivers
API->>Driver: IsDriverAvailable
Driver->>Redis: EXISTS driver_lock:id
API-->>Client: Drivers with availability


